# Required for the emulator's WebAssembly threads (SharedArrayBuffer) to work.
# Without cross-origin isolation, Play.js fails to initialize entirely.
# Recognized by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. Other hosts (S3/CloudFront,
# nginx, Vercel, etc.) need the equivalent configured at the server/CDN level.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
